<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Q Data acting chairman replaced.</title>
<headline>Q Data acting chairman replaced.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q Data Ltd said on Wednesday that acting chairman, Piet den Boer, has left the board with immediate effect and will be replaced by Leen ven der Bijl, a founder member of the information technology group.</p>
<p>It said Q Data had an &quot;exceptionally strong&quot; management team and that each of the group's companies and subsidiaries is run as autonomous business units.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
